<title>PORTUGAL: TRADE HALTED IN CR.LYONNAIS PORTUGAL UNIT- DEALERS.</title>
<headline>TRADE HALTED IN CR.LYONNAIS PORTUGAL UNIT- DEALERS.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) suspended trade in the local subsidiary of French bank Credit Lyonnais, dealers said.</p>
<p>CMVM officials were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The suspension followed press reports that Spain's Caixa da Galicia was negotiating to buy the Portuguese bank.</p>
